  "notes": [
    "GL records generated on the local Windows GPU using the original D modules and LDC, with SDL3 used solely to create the test context.",
    "animation_reference.txt compares 880 interpolation float bit patterns and 70 playback/state records.",
    "original-model.bin is generated by reference_model_io.d from a new 8x8 quad and one animation; no user model data.",
    "Comparisons cover the recorded inputs only; they are not evidence of whole-application equivalence.",
    "tracking_reference.txt: 44 local UDP snapshots from seven original app adaptors. Explicit stop completes; the D test host uses _Exit afterwards because original GC finalization faults on Windows. GC shutdown parity is not asserted.",
    "vspace_reference.txt: original non-JSON class methods extracted unchanged by prepare-vspace-reference.py; zone focus/poll order and 20 quaternion interpolation cases.",
    "expression_reference.txt: 110 Lua expression values/errors from original expression module with fixture scene/time and seed 12345.",
    "binding_reference.txt: original non-JSON binding methods with fixture parameter, input and scene boundaries; heap-address expression signature logs excluded.",
    "control_reference.txt: original non-JSON AnimationControl with the original actual AnimationPlayer; 60 updates across event, thresholds and hold delays.",
    "noise_reference.txt: 804 original OpenSimplex2 double bit patterns, four fixed seeds."
